{
 "_doc": "Tier-1 bait and tackle shop with a boathouse on piles over the north-west shore of Larch Pond (region D6). The slip is open water inside the building: its cells are yard ('.') between the slip walk (W) and the boat bay (E), under the net loft, and the placement's keep_water pad (ADR-0024) leaves the pond bed under it. Dock sections and pilings are props with their decks at the pad; the rowboat floats at the water, 0.6 m under the pad (the placement's freeboard: place it with \"keep_water\": true, \"freeboard\": 0.6). Route: the lot -> the shop padlocked from outside -> round to the dock (a bear trap under the heap of net) -> the dock door -> the slip walk (loose boards wake the mill hands in the bay across the slip) -> the bay ladder to the net loft -> Ned's keys on the nail by the hatch (taking them wakes the bay; the Hollowed can't climb, so they wait below, and Pip's fishing hole is a drop into the slip) -> down to the bait-room door padlocked from the slip side -> the shop -> Ned's office (the safe; Ned guards it) -> the bolted side door. See docs/POI_AUTHORING.md.",
